<title>UK: Brit.Gas not seeking gas supply divestments.</title>
<headline>Brit.Gas not seeking gas supply divestments.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Gas said on Monday it is not seeking to start negotiations with other parties to sell its domestic gas supply business after talks to divest part of the operations to Scottish Hydro-Electric Plc were ended.</p>
</text>
